Package: tiewm
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libx11-6, libxft2, libxext6, libxrandr2, libc6
Recommends: xfwm4
Suggests: picom, lxqt-panel
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: tiewm <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/zead73/tiewm
Description: floating X11 window manager that draws xfwm4 themes
 tiewm is a floating window manager written in Free Pascal. It draws the
 pixmap themes of xfwm4 (the themes themselves come from the xfwm4 package, a
 recommended dependency) and works with EWMH panels and taskbars such as
 lxqt-panel. It supports several monitors (RandR), workspaces, window rules,
 and a config file in ~/.config/tiewm/tiewm.conf.
 .
 Pick "tiewm" as the window manager of your session (for LXQt: Session
 Settings, Basic Settings), or choose the tiewm entry at the login screen.
